SY_TALK("B9XvQ85ez8k",[[627,["It’s such a great thing to meet your children","after such a long time."]],[633,["And","this country was really pestered with cold"]],[643,["so I had to come here I think, just to make","you feel warmer with love."]],[647,["It’s a very heartening thing to see so many","people who are in England, who are Sahaj Yogis."]],[662,["As you know England has to do tremendous effort","to keep Sahaja Yoga afloat; not only that,"]],[676,["but you have to set in examples for others."]],[683,["As England is the heart of the universe it","circulates."]],[690,["Whatever example you set in, circulates."]],[693,["People try to follow you."]],[696,["As I have told you before also, that English","people should not try to follow other people"]],[702,["but establish their own proper character."]],[706,["But not to be insular by which you don’t","appreciate anybody else or you cannot understand"]],[714,["international relationships."]],[717,["We are one world and it’s only one great","Viraat in Whose being we circulate."]],[733,["Moreover for the people who are from the heart,","[they] have to be much more open and moving"]],[742,["and giving because that’s the job of the","cell of blood that passes through [the] heart;"]],[749,["and that’s how you are made specially for","this."]],[771,["I have been speaking after you finished your","tour on a subject in India."]],[779,["But I think it is more related to us here","in the West than to Indians."]],[785,["And that is something we have to understand:","that we are in the midst of terrible conditions,"]],[794,["horrible conditions which are taking us to","hell."]],[803,["And we realise how important it is for us","to get together and save this area which we"]],[821,["called as ‘the Western world’."]],[824,["So I have already given a little talk which","you may hear when you have this seminar or"]],[832,["this Shiv puja."]],[835,["But I would like to tell you about it: that","Shri Krishna, a long time back, told that"]],[846,["the roots of the awareness are in the brain,","but the human awareness grows downward."]],[854,["That’s how we have grown downward."]],[860,["We have grown towards things which, if allowed","to grow that way, may take us away completely"]],[875,["from the roots."]],[876,["Now if you start the movement, as I said,","from Bhavasagara, from the evolutionary process,"]],[886,["of going downward."]],[889,["Now in the Bhavasagara that is in the viscera","of the stomach and all these places, we have"]],[899,["a capacity, what we call as of consumption."]],[904,["We can even consume the poison."]],[909,["The liver can consume the poison; it has the","capacity to consume the poison as heat and"]],[917,["then it delivers the heat to the water of","the bloodstream."]],[926,["So the capacity we have to consume all those","things makes us, what we call ‘swahaa’:"]],[935,["‘swahaa’ means ‘consumption’."]],[939,["And from this consumption, when we consume","all these things: we consume our ego, we consume"]],[946,["our conditioning, we consume all those things","which are detrimental to our growth [then]"]],[952,["we become ‘swadhaa’."]],[954,["‘Swa‘ is the Spirit and ‘dha’ is the","dharma."]],[958,["We get the dharma of the Spirit."]],[964,["And you know what is the dharma of the Spirit","is – is Sahaj, Sahaja."]],[970,["But when we start going downward only with","our awareness, from the Nabhi Chakra we start"]],[978,["moving downward, what happens to us [is] that","we move to the second position of Swadhishthana"]],[985,["and the Swadhishthana has got the essence,","I mean, has got the capacity to be ‘bhurvah’."]],[991,["‘Bhurvah’ means the whole Creation, the","universe that is created."]],[998,["That’s how we get creativity through Swadhishthana."]],[1002,["So when we start moving downward, what happens","to us [is] we go to all the stars and the"]],[1010,["planets and all that are created, that’s","what we are doing, wasting our energy for"]],[1015,["nothing at all."]],[1016,["But apart from that in the wrong way when","we move, our attention goes to creativity"]],[1021,["which is destructive, which is negative, which","brings death, which suggests insipidness."]],[1032,["Like the art today is, when you see the art,","you don’t know whether to vomit, to run"]],[1037,["away or to cry."]],[1040,["So that explains why people are producing","such horrid things and when you look at them"]],[1045,["you don’t understand what is this going","on."]],[1049,["So the art, the creativity, in every way,","the creativity of every kind becomes so horrid."]],[1060,["So the third stage is that we go to ‘bhuh‘."]],[1064,["‘Bhuh’ is this Mother Earth."]],[1068,["Mother Earth is the one which also creates","Shri Ganesh."]],[1072,["Now when we go towards Mother Earth we start","extracting Mother Earth, taking out all that"]],[1077,["is precious, that is needed out of proportion","– because we have got machines."]],[1082,["Now we have got machines so we must produce."]],[1085,["The machine must produce more and more and","more, out of proportion it should go on."]],[1091,["And when it wants to continue it has to go","on that way so that you feed the machine to"]],[1097,["produce more."]],[1103,["Now this production is useless!"]],[1108,["There is no need to have so much production","for us."]],[1111,["You see plastics after plastics, then there’s","nylons after nylons, then there’s all kinds"]],[1117,["of polyester and I don’t know all kinds","of things that they have started producing."]],[1121,["All man-made nonsense that they have."]],[1124,["There’s no need to have so much."]],[1127,["Then we go on accumulating things and that’s","how we become extremely materialistic people."]],[1132,["Actually to be materialistic in the real sense","is that we understand the value of matter."]],[1137,["And the value of the matter is aesthetics."]],[1140,["Artistic things, real artistic things."]],[1143,["And beyond that the value of matter is that","you can give love to others through that matter:"]],[1150,["by giving as presents, by your generosity."]],[1154,["So you lose that also!"]],[1155,["That power also you lose."]],[1157,["That is, you start extracting your Mother","Earth in such a way that you don’t know"]],[1165,["what to do with the acid gas that is coming","out of these productions and then all your"]],[1170,["trees are getting destroyed."]],[1172,["It’s so destructive."]],[1173,["The whole thing is so destructive."]],[1176,["So then you move to the essence of Mooladhara","which is innocence."]],[1185,["And when it is innocence, you start attacking","innocence."]],[1189,["Now you read horrible things, when you come","here."]],[1191,["I got the jitters when I heard about the six","year old girl and a three year old girl: I"]],[1197,["just can’t bear it."]],[1198,["Supposing that was my child what would have","happened to me?"]],[1202,["And it’s my child."]],[1203,["That’s how I feel."]],[1204,["Then we are attacking the innocence everywhere","in every place and we have no sense of Mooladhar."]],[1210,["That’s how we go down."]],[1213,["And one step forward where do we go?"]],[1217,["Into hell."]],[1220,["That is our movement."]],[1221,["We are going towards hell!"]],[1223,["Straight forward, our movement is towards","hell!"]],[1227,["Because I have explained in that little talk,","you can hear it again, that, when you see"]],[1232,["the steps, you see the downward steps, then","you just see the platforms which are very"]],[1238,["good, maybe of marble, very attractive, very","sensational, whatever you may call it."]],[1243,["And you feel like going down, it’s easy","to go down with the gravity because you have"]],[1247,["come out from amoeba state or even earlier","from carbon stage, so you feel it’s easy"]],[1256,["to go down."]],[1257,["It’s much easier to go down, so you go on","stepping on these steps and go down."]],[1263,["You don’t see the heights."]],[1265,["But when you are going higher, rising higher","then you start seeing the heights."]],[1271,["And when you see the heights what do you see","from down below?"]],[1276,["Absolutely this is our task."]],[1277,["From the hell we have to pull out people up."]],[1280,["That’s hell!"]],[1281,["And this is what we call as the ‘adhogati’","– going downward."]],[1285,["‘Adhogati’ – going downward."]],[1287,["We have to take to ‘Urdhvagati’ ( ऊर्ध्वगति)-","going higher."]],[1291,["How do we go higher?"]],[1293,["Only Kundalini is the way."]],[1295,["That you can see clearly."]],[1297,["Even people who try to go higher without the","Kundalini, say from Nabhi upwards, how do"]],[1302,["they do it?"]],[1303,["They go up to mana, this is the emotional","side, that’s the motherhood."]],[1310,["And you go against the mother."]],[1312,["When you go there what you find [is] that","you get attached to this woman, that woman,"]],[1317,["then that thing."]],[1319,["It goes on to this family, to other things","and again you come down."]],[1324,["Then you go ahead, you go into ‘janah’","– is the one which is what we call ‘the"]],[1330,["public’, ‘the others’."]],[1331,["‘Janah’ is ‘the public’, is the Viraata’s","place."]],[1334,["As you know this is the Viraata’s place."]],[1336,["And when you go to that place, to Viraata’s","place, what happens to you [is] that you start"]],[1343,["becoming very conscious of yourself, “Oh,","I am a public man."]],[1346,["I am a public person."]],[1347,["This is my reputation."]],[1348,["I am this and I am that.\""]],[1350,["And then you start exploiting people with","your politics and all other things like that."]],[1354,["And you develop your egos; all kinds of nonsensical","things."]],[1363,["With your mana, from your centre heart, you","develop also your conditionings and that’s"]],[1370,["how you develop a funny personality which","is not urdhvagati, which is not going higher,"]],[1376,["but is actually giving you additional problems","on your back!"]],[1383,["Then the third thing is here at the Agnya,","as I told you, you develop your ego."]],[1390,["The other day Patrick rang me up to say, “Mother,","why are we developing our Agnyas so much nowadays?”"]],[1395,["I said, “Stop reading newspapers!”"]],[1398,["The prime ministers are fighting for their","seats and this and that and if you read newspapers"]],[1403,["you will also feel that you are a prime minister","[and] you better fight it."]],[1407,["Because when you see a picture or any drama","sometimes you get identified and you think,"]],[1414,["“I am Napoleon myself!”"]],[1417,["So don’t read newspapers!"]],[1421,["Don’t read about these mad people who are","just trying to overpower each other."]],[1427,["Like this [Ferdinand] Marcos fellow."]],[1430,["The other day somebody said that, “Mother,","you get rid of this Marcos!”"]],[1432,["Now he’s out!"]],[1433,["So many will be out but what about us?"]],[1435,["Do we have some of them within our heads?"]],[1438,["Do we also have the same ideas of materialism","or ego or all these trips that these people"]],[1446,["have had?"]],[1447,["So as a result, when you see these things,","on the contrary, you should try to avoid it"]],[1453,["and jump on to urdhvagati."]],[1457,["Then you go higher, from there, in the head","is the Sat, is the Truth."]],[1462,["That’s what you discover, Truth; should","discover in the normal way."]],[1466,["But in the abnormal conditions when you try","just to climb up to the brain, what happens"]],[1473,["is that whatever you know through your mental","conception becomes the truth."]],[1480,["Everyone is like that."]],[1481,["You see, about religion you will find a person","believes that, “This is the truth."]],[1485,["Now this is the truth!”"]],[1486,["“I am the one who represents Christianity”,","“I am the one who represents Mohammad Sahib”,"]],[1493,["“I am the one who represents Nanak Sahib”,","“I am the one who represents Shri Rama,"]],[1499,["Shri Krishna.\""]],[1501,["None of them represent."]],[1502,["It’s just a concept."]],[1504,["And with that concept if you move about like","that then what happens [is] you just get stuck"]],[1508,["on to that idea."]],[1510,["That is how fanaticism comes in as far as","religion is concerned."]],[1513,["There are many, many things like that, “This","is a concept and that’s the fact, and that’s"]],[1519,["the truth and that’s what I believe in this!”"]],[1523,["But why do you believe in that?"]],[1525,["Who are you?"]],[1527,["When they say, “I believe,” just go and","ask them, “Who are you after all to believe"]],[1530,["in that?”"]],[1531,["That’s Mr."]],[1532,["Ego, that’s all."]],[1534,["Then there are people who are conditioned."]],[1537,["And that’s what, whatever is their conditioning,","they think, “This is the conditioning."]],[1541,["This is the thing I am brought up."]],[1542,["This is how I have lived and this is how I","am, and this is what is the truth.\""]],[1547,["Both things are absurd, mythical."]],[1552,["That’s not the Truth."]],[1556,["So when you start through your urdhvagati,","through your Kundalini you see the height."]],[1562,["You see that, “Now we have to rise!"]],[1564,["We have to rise."]],[1565,["Rise with our innocence."]],[1566,["We have to get to our innocence.\""]],[1568,["We have to be innocent people."]],[1572,["But even in Sahaja Yoga you will find some","people, I call them sometimes like monkeys,"]],[1576,["jump from urdhvagati to adhogati, adhogati","to urdhvagati."]],[1578,["You don’t know which side they are going!"]],[1585,["You have to hold on to these steps which you","have got."]],[1587,["First is the innocence."]],[1589,["Your morality, as you call that, or a chastity."]],[1595,["That’s the first step you have to achieve."]],[1598,["Unless and until you achieve that step how","are you going to go further?"]],[1605,["But it’s the other way round."]],[1606,["They think if you tell something very truthfully","to Mother, “I have had five love affairs,"]],[1611,["I have had six abortions, ten this thing,","then Mother is going to be very happy with"]],[1617,["me,” because they have told the truth."]],[1620,["That’s not the truth."]],[1622,["That’s not what is wanted."]],[1625,["Are you now a chaste person?"]],[1627,["Have you got the ideas of chastity and dharma?"]],[1633,["That is the second step you can move into."]],[1637,["Aesthetically, are you rich aesthetically,","are you generous?"]],[1643,["Can you appreciate the art of every country?"]],[1646,["Or you just say, “Oh it’s not good because","it’s not English!”?"]],[1650,["Or “It’s not good because it’s not French!”?"]],[1652,["Or maybe, “It’s not from Wimbledon!”"]],[1654,["Could come to that point!"]],[1658,["I mean, what is happening to us?"]],[1660,["We are becoming so insular, so small, so narrow","in our outlook, that’s impossible."]],[1669,["We cannot appreciate another person at all."]],[1672,["You ask anyone, everybody has an opinion about","others, what about yourself?"]],[1677,["What is your opinion about yourself?"]],[1679,["Can you laugh at yourself?"]],[1682,["And when I am giving lecture we also sometimes","think that Mother is talking about somebody"]],[1687,["xyz, not about me."]],[1688,["That’s not so."]],[1690,["We have to project to ourselves and find out:","are we in chastity?"]],[1695,["Are we in dharma?"]],[1696,["Have we achieved that?"]],[1697,["Have we achieved our innocence?"]],[1700,["Have our eyes achieved that innocence, that","simplicity, that power?"]],[1709,["So then we move up higher on the bhurvah state","where we have to know: are we aesthetically"]],[1718,["equipped?"]],[1719,["Do we have proper aesthetics?"]],[1725,["In our behaviour, in our dress, in our lifestyle,","in everything?"]],[1732,["Or are we still going on with the same things?"]],[1736,["Like some hippies when they come to Sahaja","Yoga, it’s impossible to make them understand"]],[1740,["that – no more hippies now!"]],[1746,["Then some come from another group, another","funny style, then they have the same style"]],[1751,["of behaviour."]],[1752,["No!"]],[1753,["‘Sahaja’: we have to be in the Sahaja","style, which is a common style for all the"]],[1759,["Sahaja Yogis all over the world to dress up","decently, to talk decently, to have sweet"]],[1763,["words, no harsh words, no anger, no temper,","nothing of the kind."]],[1769,["But very, very gentle and a dignified personality."]],[1776,["Now here some of the so-called dignified also","can be very bhootish, I have seen that."]],[1782,["They can be very dignified and they can be","very inauspicious."]],[1787,["So another quality of innocence, which is","auspiciousness; or we can say the combination"]],[1793,["of innocence and bhurvah state is auspiciousness."]],[1796,["Does your house give auspiciousness?"]],[1797,["Does your countenance give auspiciousness?"]],[1799,["Is your talk auspicious?"]],[1801,["Is it a mantra when you talk?"]],[1810,["Have you purified yourself so much that everything","that you do, every movement that you have,"]],[1815,["is auspicious?"]],[1818,["Is it blissful to be in your house?"]],[1822,["To be in your company?"]],[1824,["To be with you?"]],[1825,["Is it blissful?"]],[1826,["Let us direct ourselves to ourselves and see","that: are we blissful?"]],[1831,["Are we emitting vibrations that are good?"]],[1839,["It’s a very tremendous task because you","have to do it!"]],[1843,["You have to do it!"]],[1844,["Nobody else is going to do it!"]],[1846,["If you want to save this world, you must know","it’s a tremendous task and one has to go"]],[1851,["into a tapah for that, to know that you have","to be pure people."]],[1858,["Otherwise there could be hypocrites."]],[1860,["There are many who are Sahaja Yogis and not","at all Sahaja Yogis."]],[1863,["Sahaja Yoga is not for hypocrites at all."]],[1866,["You cannot be a hypocrite."]],[1868,["You have to be what you preach, what you say,","what you understand and what we stand for."]],[1873,["It’s not like this, “Oh I am a Christian,","all right, I am a Christian, but it’s all"]],[1879,["right, I can have adulterous eyes, all right","because after all, you see it’s all allowed.\""]],[1884,["“Then what else?”"]],[1886,["“Oh, I can drink, smoke.\""]],[1888,["“What else?”"]],[1889,["“Oh, I can also kill some people, it doesn’t","matter you see."]],[1892,["It’s all right I’m Christian after all.\""]],[1897,["How are you a Christian?"]],[1900,["Then, “I am a Hindu, you see I am a perfect","Hindu, but doesn’t matter if I try to discriminate"]],[1909,["between Sikhs and Hindus, doesn’t matter.\""]],[1912,["How, why?"]],[1913,["There’s no discrimination allowed in Hinduism."]],[1916,["No discrimination of any kind."]],[1918,["Everybody has the same Atma."]],[1923,["How can you discriminate?"]],[1924,["How can you have dowry system in a Hindu society?"]],[1928,["How can you have any caste system in a Hindu","society?"]],[1933,["You cannot have, just cannot have."]],[1936,["It’s not the religion."]],[1938,["So they speak one thing, do another thing,","it’s all hypocrites and all fanatics."]],[1944,["And that’s how they become fanatics!"]],[1946,["Like you ask Bishop of Canterbury, he says","that, “Holy Ghost, I don’t know, I am"]],[1952,["agnostic about it!"]],[1954,["I am doing my job!”"]],[1956,["That’s all!"]],[1957,["This kind of frivolous attitude or we can","say a very hypocritical attitude is not for"]],[1963,["the Sahaja Yogis."]],[1964,["They have to be what they are preaching, what","they are standing for."]],[1967,["They cannot have that kind of a personality","that one can say, “Oh, I have seen this"]],[1973,["hypocritical fellow, calls himself Sahaja","Yogi!”"]],[1976,["We can’t!"]],[1978,["There has to be somebody who is genuine, who","is real, who is truthful."]],[1983,["We cannot live with that kind of a compromise."]],[1988,["We have to be what we are because we have","got the light of the Spirit."]],[1994,["So then you go ahead and you have to become","the higher personality of a guru through consumption."]],[2003,["Consume, how much I consume!"]],[2006,["Go on consuming all the time."]],[2009,["This time I came, I am consuming your Left","Vishuddhis, I am consuming your viruses."]],[2013,["I don’t know, in two days I must have consumed","oceans and oceans of troubles."]],[2019,["No, we don’t consume at all!"]],[2023,["Because if somebody says something to us we","must come back with a harsh word, somehow"]],[2028,["or other to kill that person that is finished","forever – that’s smartness."]],[2034,["We can consume all that."]],[2038,["That consumption is taught by Christ very","well."]],[2041,["Can we consume?"]],[2042,["No!"]],[2043,["We come out with big, big talks and big, big","things, you see, “We must do this, we must"]],[2050,["do that!”"]],[2051,["We are not here union leaders, are we?"]],[2056,["We don’t want to appear in the newspapers","or anything."]],[2059,["What we want [is] to consume, we are here","to consume things."]],[2063,["Newspapers are to advertise, expand it."]],[2068,["We are here to consume all that is bad."]],[2071,["Do you follow your responsibility please?"]],[2074,["Consume [all] that is wrong."]],[2078,["How do we consume?"]],[2079,["Through meditation, through prayers."]],[2081,["Now this is happening in this country."]],[2084,["What are we doing about it?"]],[2088,["So we have to consume it, not to get into","explosions, not to get into expressions, but"]],[2095,["to consume it."]],[2100,["Then you become swadhaa."]],[2103,["‘Swadhaa’ is that you become the dharma","of the Spirit – ‘swa’, ‘dha’."]],[2114,["You sustain that dharma within yourself."]],[2117,["Then you become that."]],[2118,["It’s not any kind of hypocrisy about it."]],[2121,["I mean, if I say, “Don’t drink.\""]],[2124,["You shouldn’t drink wine."]],[2125,["I don’t drink at all I mean, no question!"]],[2127,["I mean, you cannot make me drink even if you","want to."]],[2131,["If I say, “Don’t tell lies!” then you","don’t tell lies."]],[2134,["You don’t just do it because you have to","just say that way, or you say that, “Don’t"]],[2140,["kill!”"]],[2141,["I cannot kill anyone."]],[2146,["I cannot be tempted."]],[2149,["In the same way you all have to feel, “I","cannot do it, I cannot be tempted."]],[2153,["How can I be tempted?”"]],[2155,["Say, “I shouldn’t get into tempers."]],[2157,["I shouldn’t be angry for nothing at all.\""]],[2159,["For the slightest thing, people just jump","into a temper."]],[2163,["That means, “I should not be tempted to","do that.\""]],[2167,["That wisdom, that dignity, that balance, that","poise must come into a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2172,["Unless and until that comes into you who is","going to believe you that you have achieved"]],[2177,["anything of this transformation?"]],[2178,["You are still on adhogati, sometimes into","urdhvagati."]],[2180,["Then going into adhogati, again to urdhvagati."]],[2182,["You are jumping from one to another."]],[2188,["So now you move on to another higher level,","is from there to [where], what you call, the"]],[2200,["‘Mahalakshmi tattwa’ starts; where you","start jumping on to a much higher position"]],[2205,["where it is mana."]],[2207,["‘Mana’ is emotions."]],[2209,["Your emotions become compassion."]],[2211,["Now see the difference between emotions and","compassion: is very different."]],[2216,["When the tree hasn’t got flowers it takes,","when it gets the flower, it gives, it gives"]],[2225,["the fragrance."]],[2226,["In the same way, when you become the compassion,","you give."]],[2230,["You don’t expect how others treat you, how","others behave towards you, but you think [that]"]],[2237,["by giving you will win over the person."]],[2239,["You give."]],[2242,["And that is what you have got: to give compassion","through your vibrations."]],[2251,["But to have that you have to be swadhaa."]],[2255,["Unless and until you have that you cannot","give vibrations either."]],[2258,["So then all these smaller ideas, “It’s","my wife, my husband, my child, my house, my"]],[2265,["this, my brother, my sister.\""]],[2267,["In the beginning everybody comes up with the","whole family list."]],[2271,["They may not have seen their father for ten","years but they’ll come, “My father is"]],[2275,["sick, Mother cure him first."]],[2276,["I have not seen him for ten years.\""]],[2278,["Doesn’t matter!"]],[2279,["So every person becomes a liability on Mother","that all the relations, all the great grand"]],[2284,["parents and all the great grand children must","be cured by Sahaja Yoga."]],[2293,["But there is no compassion!"]],[2302,["And in compassion you do not see these relations."]],[2343,["So, when you become the compassion, before","this you are to be enlightened."]],[2360,["You are to be enlightened, you have no light,","you don’t know how to walk the path, you"]],[2364,["don’t know how to go round, you don’t","know how to know others, you don’t know"]],[2369,["where you are sitting."]],[2370,["If in a group, you put off the lights everybody","starts hitting each other or trampling over"]],[2376,["each other because they don’t know."]],[2379,["But now the lights are on."]],[2381,["So you know how you are related to each other."]],[2383,["You are under the light."]],[2386,["You can see each other."]],[2387,["You can feel each other."]],[2388,["You can understand each other."]],[2390,["That’s how the compassion works."]],[2394,["Compassion works automatically – you don’t","have to do much about it."]],[2398,["But know that you have to be a compassion."]],[2400,["But if you are still are a person wanting","others to love you then it won’t work out."]],[2409,["How much did you love them?"]],[2418,["Is your love for another person doubted?"]],[2421,["Do you doubt?"]],[2424,["Then you are not compassion."]],[2427,["In that love you may even scold the person,","you may even shout at the person."]],[2431,["But the love should be there for the benevolence."]],[2437,["So the compassion should be for the benevolence","of the person."]],[2441,["If you are not benevolent you have not been","compassionate."]],[2444,["Like spoiling somebody, spoiling your child,","spoiling your wife, spoiling your husband."]],[2449,["This is not compassion!"]],[2450,["Compassion is a pure ray of beautiful light","of God’s love which gives benevolence to"]],[2461,["another person, hita."]],[2466,["So that should happen to you when you talk","of compassion."]],[2470,["You go further with the janah – public."]],[2474,["Those people who cannot carry on with Sahaja","Yogis are absolutely useless people."]],[2479,["These are the cream, these are the best people","in the whole world."]],[2485,["Of course some are like this, doesn’t matter."]],[2488,["But they are the topmost people, they are","the people wedded to such high ideals."]],[2493,["Where do you get anybody with idealism?"]],[2496,["You go to the UN, you go anywhere you find","people, they have no idealism of any kind."]],[2501,["It’s only for the job, only for the money,","or this or that, [that] they are working there."]],[2507,["You are the people who have idealism."]],[2510,["You are the people who are striving for something","higher."]],[2513,["You are the people who are going to save the","whole world."]],[2516,["And those who cannot carry on with Sahaja","Yogis and find faults with Sahaja Yogis are"]],[2521,["really no good for us."]],[2523,["They should get out of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2528,["What is your public?"]],[2529,["First and foremost is Sahaja Yogis."]],[2532,["The rest of them are outsiders so far."]],[2537,["But your attitude should be that you have","to pull them out."]],[2541,["You have to emancipate."]],[2542,["You have to be kind to them."]],[2543,["You have to be compassionate."]],[2545,["And you have to bring them to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2547,["You have to be extremely nice to them."]],[2550,["But more than that you have to be very, very,","extremely nice to Sahaja Yogis."]],[2558,["I can’t understand Sahaja Yogis being nice","to others and not to their own clan or you"]],[2563,["can call whatever you may call it – to their","own brothers and sisters."]],[2575,["When I see Sahaja Yogis together loving each","other, being kind to each other and also giving"]],[2581,["some good news about each other I feel extremely","happy."]],[2585,["That’s one of the most joyous times for","me."]],[2591,["When I find that you are giving."]],[2633,["So then you come to the point where you are","in the public, you are in the public."]],[2644,["You have to circulate now."]],[2645,["You have to articulate in the public."]],[2647,["You have to move in the public."]],[2649,["You are not only for a secluded group of Sahaja","Yogis, you are not that."]],[2655,["But you have to articulate, you have to circulate."]],[2660,["Now for that, what should we do?"]],[2666,["You have to understand that we have to form","other groups, other things by which we can"]],[2677,["circulate."]],[2678,["Let’s see now in England we can form some","societies."]],[2680,["Let’s form some society which are not what","we call them as the Sahaja Yogas."]],[2689,["Because you are different from them."]],[2691,["So now let us form some societies."]],[2693,["We form certain societies, say let us form","a society where we talk about the decadence"]],[2700,["of this country; how the decadence has come","in, why it is there, why are we spoiling our"]],[2709,["young children, why are we behaving like this."]],[2711,["Let us see."]],[2712,["Let us start a society under this name."]],[2716,["Let us start a society which will fight all","social problems."]],[2723,["Like I said in India: let us start a society","which is against dowry system."]],[2728,["That’s how you will circulate with them."]],[2731,["And later on when they come up to a point","they will see your character and then you"]],[2735,["can talk to them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2741,["Like these women have, what is that called?"]],[2743,["‘Women’s lib’ and all that."]],[2746,["I mean, it is nonsense, you know that very","well."]],[2749,["But they have formed the society, so they","are there, they are circulating."]],[2754,["We have to have sensible, wise people forming","a society."]],[2758,["So from Sahaja Yoga group we have to move","to society: where you need not talk about"]],[2764,["Sahaja Yoga, you need not tell them there","is emancipation."]],[2767,["But let us circulate through them and let","them know about dharma."]],[2774,["Forming no religion as such."]],[2775,["It’s inner religion as we have."]],[2778,["Just without any religion you can start it","off."]],[2781,["So that’s how you meet the public."]],[2783,["There are many such ways, which you can think,","by which you can meet the public."]],[2788,["And then you have to know you are the part","and parcel of your Mother."]],[2793,["There are three things asked from God: that","there is salokya, that, “Oh God, We should"]],[2804,["be able to see you,” salokya."]],[2806,["Samipya is, “Oh God, let us have your company.\""]],[2811,["And third one is, “Oh God let us have a","rapport with you.\""]],[2825,["Rapport with you."]],[2827,["These are the three things are asked from","God."]],[2831,["But the fourth thing that has happened to","you is tadatmya, means you have become part"]],[2835,["and parcel of my body."]],[2836,["As a result of that you have to keep your","body all right, you have to be pure people,"]],[2843,["you have to be sensible, otherwise I get into","trouble."]],[2847,["But it’s a very venturesome thing I have","done, doesn’t matter, I don’t mind."]],[2855,["But you people look after yourselves."]],[2858,["You be sensible people."]],[2860,["And when you have funny ideas in your head,","know that these funny ideas can trouble our"]],[2865,["Mother very much."]],[2867,["So out of love for me, you have to keep loving","yourself."]],[2873,["And you can love yourself only if you have","pure intelligence to know what is frivolous,"]],[2879,["what is nonsensical, whatever is asahaj."]],[2887,["So you move like one body, always support","each other."]],[2889,["If one person is troubled the rest of them","should help."]],[2892,["That’s how the collectivity is going to","work out."]],[2895,["Not to criticise each other, to sit down and","just to show off."]],[2905,["So then you rise even higher to this state","of Jesus Christ, Mahavira and Buddha."]],[2914,["Then what do you have to do?"]],[2917,["Is tapaha, is the penance."]],[2921,["You have to do the penance."]],[2923,["Like living in Brahmapuri was a penance, I","thought, but you all enjoyed it bit too much."]],[2929,["Or Ganapatipule, you thought it was too much."]],[2931,["Some people did do some penance by sitting","in the sun! (laughing) But penance means ‘sacrifice’."]],[2945,["Sacrifice."]],[2949,["Without feeling the sacrifice, do the work","as a sacrifice."]],[2953,["You are bound by work."]],[2957,["We have to work."]],[2958,["Human beings have to work."]],[2960,["But the work that is a sacrifice is the most","nourishing thing, is the most joy-giving thing."]],[2965,["And that’s what happened: in Brahmapuri","I must say it was very spartan, both for you"]],[2972,["and for your hosts it was quite a funny place","to live in."]],[2978,["And one snake crawled into somebody’s shoes","I am told, but still you all enjoyed it because"]],[2985,["you didn’t feel the sacrifice."]],[2986,["It was in a way [a] sacrifice for both the","parties I think: your hosts and the guests."]],[2993,["But you still enjoyed."]],[2995,["And that’s what it is."]],[2997,["Now you will enjoy your sacrifices."]],[3001,["Apart from all other virtues you will enjoy","your sacrifices."]],[3004,["That is one of the quality of the Spirit,","because you are so detached."]],[3009,["You will enjoy it!"]],[3017,["So that’s how you come to the state of tapah."]],[3019,["And the last is satya, is the truth."]],[3025,["That is what is in the brain as Shri Krishna","has described, are the roots where you have"]],[3030,["to go."]],[3031,["Of course, the doors are open to you."]],[3034,["You must know that you know the truth!"]],[3036,["You know the truth, nobody else."]],[3039,["Are you aware of this, that you are the only","few people under this roof who know the truth?"]],[3050,["The rest don’t know any truth whatsoever."]],[3052,["So you have to be compassionate to them because","they are blind, they can’t see."]],[3056,["As we are kind to the blind people we have","to be kind to the people who do not know the"]],[3060,["truth."]],[3061,["You know the truth!"]],[3062,["And the truth is that you are the Spirit."]],[3068,["And then you know, through all miracles, that","you are walking in the Kingdom of Heaven."]],[3074,["That you are blessed by God and that you are","looked after by Him."]],[3077,["So many miracles happen, so many of these,","that suggest that you are really looked after"]],[3083,["by God Almighty."]],[3085,["So many beautiful things have happened to","you."]],[3088,["Just think of them one by one from where to","where we have come."]],[3092,["From down below hell rising up one by one,","step by step, now we have come to the brain."]],[3099,["Thanks to our Kundalinis that we have come","up there, that the Mother has brought you"]],[3106,["there."]],[3107,["This Kundalini which is your Mother has brought","you there."]],[3111,["Respect Her and respect your Realisation."]],[3115,["Respect each other and know that you are higher","than billions and billions of people of this"]],[3121,["earth."]],[3122,["You are special people and as that you have","to behave in the most humble, respectable"]],[3130,["and a loving manner."]],[3131,["I say love is the highest."]],[3135,["Everyone who has developed a language of love","is working out God’s wish because God’s"]],[3145,["wish, His desire, His iccha, that Shakti,","is the power of love."]],[3154,["We work out everything with hatred: what’s","wrong with that person, what’s wrong with"]],[3158,["that house, what’s wrong with this association,","with that."]],[3162,["That is all hatred."]],[3163,["But let’s see what’s good with that, what’s","nice, what’s joyful."]],[3169,["When your eyes turn that way, when your attitudes","turn like that, then you must know that you"]],[3175,["are Sahaj Yogis."]],[3179,["For that Christ has given us a big weapon","called forgive, forgive, forgive."]],[3189,["And the truth has dawned upon you."]],[3190,["You know the truth."]],[3192,["Through your vibrations you know, through","your vibratory awareness you know."]],[3195,["But, there is a very big ‘but’ for which","I have to tell you again and again and I am"]],[3201,["telling you again today which is the most","important thing for a Sahaj Yogi – is to"]],[3204,["use your vibratory awareness."]],[3207,["They don’t!"]],[3208,["They just don’t use their vibratory awareness."]],[3211,["In judging others they never use their vibratory","awareness."]],[3214,["Then how do we say they are special people?"]],[3217,["Because you have the same eyes, you have nose."]],[3219,["What about your vibratory awareness?"]],[3222,["Did you see the vibrations when you did something?"]],[3225,["You did not!"]],[3227,["That’s why the mistakes."]],[3229,["Because these vibrations come as an indication","from something that is your Spirit, which"]],[3235,["is an absolute thing, which is in absolute","state – it is not relative."]],[3240,["It’s absolute."]],[3241,["So whatever information it gives you is absolute."]],[3245,["And you should take to that absolute understanding."]],[3247,["This is where we miss."]],[3252,["So today just before Shiva Puja, Shiva Puja","is the puja of the Spirit within you."]],[3258,["It’s the Spirit within you."]],[3263,["And for this puja specially you have to determine","that now we will use our vibratory awareness"]],[3270,["to judge something."]],[3272,["“I think…” is not there."]],[3274,["“I think…” is a wrong idea."]],[3281,["I know through vibratory awareness."]],[3284,["We have to develop a word for this, which","we say, “I feel…” it could be something"]],[3290,["nonsensical."]],[3292,["But you really, as they say in Marathi there’s","a word, ‘zanee’: is a feeling."]],[3303,["But it’s a new awareness."]],[3306,["Through this awareness, this Divine awareness,","through that, you have to judge everything,"]],[3310,["to know everything, and to do everything through","that."]],[3313,["This is what we have to use."]],[3319,["And when we start doing that then you will","know that God is working out everything for"]],[3327,["us."]],[3328,["It’s so simple."]],[3330,["Life becomes much simpler."]],[3331,["All your complications, all your angers, all","your troubles, all will vanish as soon as"]],[3338,["you start using this, because it is such an","universal thing and such a benevolent blessing."]],[3344,["It just makes you wonderful."]],[3349,["You become a wonderful personality: happy","joyous, straight-forward, open-hearted, fearless."]],[3360,["Absolutely enchanting."]],[3362,["May God bless you all."]],[3367,["You want to have any questions?"]],[3373,["This lecture has been rather complicated I","think, in a way, so it’s better to repeat"]],[3387,["it or them, sometimes, again."]],[3388,["Maybe at Shiv puja would be a good idea."]],[3395,["Any question please?"]],[3396,["New Lady: How can you forgive a person like","Hitler?"]],[3405,["Shri Mataji: Actually, you see, you don’t","do anything."]],[3408,["When you forgive or not forgive, you really","don’t do anything."]],[3410,["It’s a myth."]],[3411,["It’s just a myth."]],[3412,["“I don’t forgive.\""]],[3413,["Means what do you do?"]],[3414,["It’s a myth."]],[3415,["New Lady: It’s how you feel towards a person","who has committed so many crimes and the detention"]],[3429,["of Jews."]],[3431,["Shri Mataji: But what about Jewish now?"]],[3435,["If they had forgiven Hitler, God would have","looked after him!"]],[3439,["God is looking after him."]],[3440,["But when the Jews didn’t forgive him, they","have become more like Hitler, sometimes."]],[3444,["They behave like Hitler sometimes I feel."]],[3447,["The way they are treating PLO people is something","horrible."]],[3450,["You see, so if you do not forgive you become","like the person you are hating."]],[3456,["If you forgive you don’t become like that."]],[3458,["Just that person goes out of your mind completely."]],[3460,["I mean, they have imbibed certain qualities","now."]],[3463,["I can’t imagine Jews behaving like this!"]],[3466,["They are behaving in a very funny manner."]],[3469,["You can see it clearly!"]],[3470,["I mean, they had no place to go, they had","no land to live, they were given a land."]],[3478,["And now the way they are troubling PLOs, I","was amazed."]],[3482,["Because I met some of the students of this","PLO people who came to India, who have been"]],[3486,["given asylum."]],[3487,["And when I heard how Jews tortured them – just","like Hitler, just like Hitler."]],[3493,["I wish they had forgiven."]],[3496,["I mean, if they had not forgiven Hitler, what","did they do out of it?"]],[3501,["Nothing!"]],[3502,["Hitler is punished by God, not by you."]],[3504,["What can you punish him?"]],[3506,["You cannot punish him."]],[3509,["Alright?"]],[3512,["When we forgive, we don’t imbibe that cruelty","within ourselves."]],[3516,["That’s the biggest thing that happens."]],[3518,["Apart from that we do not suffer when we forgive."]],[3524,["I mean, if you go on thinking about it, what","people did say, imagine, think of the people"]],[3534,["when Mr."]],[3535,["Columbus reached America, who followed them","[and] what they did there!"]],[3539,["Horrible things."]],[3540,["I mean, worse than Hitler."]],[3543,["They wiped out each and every person from","there."]],[3547,["Then when they tried to consume other countries,","going to other countries and ruling them."]],[3552,["If you go to China you will be shocked, even","about English, what they have to say."]],[3556,["Even in India, if you go, you will find."]],[3558,["How can anybody forgive them if you think","what they have done?"]],[3563,["But that is finished now and gone, forever!"]],[3568,["You are not to think about it at all."]],[3571,["It’s finished."]],[3572,["Today, what is the situation, we have to see."]],[3576,["You will be amazed, if I tell you, that myself,","I was tortured by English very much."]],[3582,["So what?"]],[3583,["For me you are my children."]],[3585,["I don’t think of that at all because that’s","finished."]],[3587,["They were bhootish people, that’s all – finished."]],[3590,["Where are they?"]],[3591,["Where is Hitler today?"]],[3592,["Where are those people who died?"]],[3594,["Finished!"]],[3595,["Better to forgive so that God punishes them","well."]],[3600,["Now, today, is not the time of punishing anyone,","it’s the time of evolving, of helping people"]],[3607,["to rise above that."]],[3608,["So there is no more danger of getting any","Hitlers on this Earth."]],[3612,["We have to create such a beautiful garden!"]],[3614,["Why to think of the thorns?"]],[3617,["Forget about all that nonsense, you see!"]],[3620,["These are special blossom times: let us think","of the flowers and not of the past and the"]],[3627,["thorns that we had finished off."]],[3630,["We have to give something very beautiful to","our children."]],[3634,["Isn’t it?"]],[3635,["A heritage where people will say, “Oh, I","see."]],[3638,["There were people who forgave all such things","and created a beautiful world for us!”"]],[3646,["Isn’t it a nice thought?"]],[3652,["Better than not forgiving."]],[3656,["Like that we go on thinking about, “He did","this and he did that.\""]],[3662,["There’s no end to it!"]],[3663,["God looks after!"]],[3665,["He’ll punish."]],[3666,["He’s punished him so badly."]],[3667,["Now nobody wants to take Hitler’s name!"]],[3669,["I mean, if somebody sees Hitler’s photograph","somewhere he will go and have a bath in India."]],[3675,["He’ll just go to the river Ganges and have","a bath, “Oh God!"]],[3679,["How did I see Hitler’s face anywhere?”"]],[3685,["What more you want as a punishment for Hitler","that they can ’t even face his photograph?"]],[3693,["And some person who looks like Hitler, they’ll","say, “You just shave off your moustache"]],[3697,["at least!"]],[3699,["Don’t look like that."]],[3703,["It’s very inauspicious!”"]],[3706,["Yes, I know somebody who looked like Hitler","and they said, “You shave off your moustache"]],[3710,["and comb your hair from the other side, or","make it a parting in the centre."]],[3715,["We can’t see you like this early in the","morning!”"]],[3721,["Imagine!"]],[3722,["What an inauspicious face! (laughter) He’s","hated by anyone."]],[3728,["You go to any place."]],[3730,["Even in Germany they hate him."]],[3732,["So what’s the use of such a character being","so much dominant on our heads?"]],[3739,["Have nothing to do with it."]],[3742,["Because once you start thinking about him","you also develop certain habits that he had."]],[3746,["A little cruelty comes up when you become","angry and when you cannot forgive others,"]],[3751,["you also think it’s right that you can punish","others."]],[3754,["Here we are not fighting the sword with a","sword but with a shield."]],[3758,["We are fighting the sword with a shield."]],[3762,["We never fight sword with a sword, we fight","it with a shield."]],[3770,["That’s a wise attitude towards life, I think."]],[3778,["Otherwise you will create more Hitlers."]],[3780,["One Hitler is dead and now ten Hitlers have","come out – already have come out!"]],[3783,["They are all to be finished now, once [and]","for all."]],[3793,["You can help by creating a new pattern, a","new world of beauty."]],[3818,["Any other question please?"]],[3819,["That’s a nice question, I know it happens","to her."]],[3823,["But now you are feeling better inside aren’t","you?"]],[3828,["(laughing) Much more!"]],[3830,["That’s how we have to bring peace on this","Earth."]],[3832,["How are we going to bring peace if there’s","still lurking anger?"]],[3839,["Not forgiving means anger!"]],[3842,["That’s all."]],[3847,["Hmmm."]],[3850,["What else?"]],[3855,["Ask some questions at least!"]],[3858,["Must ask some questions."]],[3860,["Yes, what’s that doctor?"]],[3863,["Dr."]],[3864,["Brian Wells: Shri Mataji, sometimes in my","work I find myself getting very angry with"]],[3879,["the people I work with is this ever appropriate","or should one always try and love and forgive"]],[3887,["them and be gentle."]],[3888,["Shri Mataji: Yes, better try that! (laughter)","As far as possible!"]],[3889,["But sometimes anger can also help."]],[3890,["But I think, just now, for us, we are developing","now, it’s better to take to the more gentler"]],[3894,["ways and things like that and not to get angry","– for the time being."]],[3897,["But we’ll have to show anger sometimes."]],[3899,["Let God show the anger."]],[3902,["Let him take the credit."]],[3905,["You will be more effective if you are gentle,","I tell you."]],[3910,["By anger you cannot correct people, you cannot","make them more efficient; but by love."]],[3919,["Those days are gone where anger and hot-temper","used to impress people."]],[3923,["Nowadays these people don’t like such people."]],[3928,["Anger or some people are also very silly."]],[3932,["They think [that] by being silly they’ll","impress others: like clowns or something."]],[3936,["It’s not so."]],[3937,["Now we are different people in this world","and they just know that this is a silly person,"]],[3944,["that’s all."]],[3946,["They expect a leader or anybody who has to","give something to others has to be something"]],[3952,["of a higher and a better personality – it’s","expected."]],[3962,["Cheapish things or anything that is publicly","people may like you to do, it a leader does"]],[3973,["that they don’t like it, they don’t like","it."]],[3978,["A leader is supposed to be something above,","above the normal."]],[3985,["But the idea of leadership these days is alright:","everybody is doing the ‘shake’ so the"]],[3989,["leader is doing the shake."]],[3990,["Then everybody wears a tight jean [so] the","leader also wears the tight jean and he can’t"]],[3996,["sit on his chair!"]],[3998,["So that’s not the way."]],[4000,["That’s not the way you can be leaders."]],[4003,["A leader has to make a pattern of his own."]],[4007,["And he doesn’t have to solve the problems","of the people but give them the problem to"]],[4011,["be solved."]],[4012,["That’s how leadership works out."]],[4014,["So for anybody who wants to get anything done,","must learn that the pattern should be of such"]],[4019,["a level that others should not take advantage,","should not think that they can bring you to"]],[4029,["your level."]],[4030,["For example, I’ll tell you: in India there’s","a habit of eating tobacco, dried tobacco."]],[4035,["Now, those people who eat tobacco, say there’s","a high court judge – he’ll call his peon"]],[4041,["and ask him “Have you go the…”, they","call it ‘dubbi’ means a small little pouch,"]],[4050,["so, “Have you got the dubbi?”"]],[4056,["So, the whole dignity is finished!"]],[4059,["Whole dignity is finished!"]],[4061,["That, just an ordinary peon can say, “Do","you want your dubbi?”"]],[4066,["So then it’s done."]],[4068,["What about his great position and dress and","everything?"]],[4074,["He makes a big gown and wears [and] on the","head they wear a kind of a wig."]],[4082,["And all that is useless because you are asking","for a dubbi from a peon!"]],[4094,["So what impresses people is dignity, balance,","poise, humility and truthfulness – straightforward"]],[4102,["truthfulness – even in day to day work."]],[4107,["Of course efficiency comes like that."]],[4114,["Peacemaking."]],[4119,["You must make peace between two persons, ten","persons."]],[4121,["Try to make peace instead of supporting one","person or taking sides."]],[4126,["Best is to make peace."]],[4128,["But if somebody is doing absolutely wrong,","then you have to take another attitude."]],[4139,["Any other question?"]],[4140,["Yes?"]],[4142,["Yogini: (unclear)"]],[4144,["Shri Mataji: What’s she saying?"]],[4151,["Yogi: She’s asking you to tell us how we","settle down in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4162,["For the new people."]],[4163,["Shri Mataji: Settle down in Sahaja Yoga?"]],[4164,["You are already settled!"]],[4165,["Gavin Brown: Some of the new people have come","quite new to Sahaja Yoga, they haven’t met"]],[4178,["you before Mother."]],[4179,["Shri Mataji: You see, I was born so settled","down I don’t know! (laughter) First of all,"]],[4186,["in Sahaja Yoga, one has to realise that you","have got vibrations."]],[4193,["Now, put it on that."]],[4195,["I think that’s the best criteria."]],[4197,["“Am I getting my vibrations alright?"]],[4201,["Are they flowing alright?"]],[4202,["If not, what’s wrong with me?”"]],[4204,["Direct your attention to yourself to find","out."]],[4207,["“Is there anything wrong with me that I","cannot get my vibrations alright?"]],[4210,["Alright!"]],[4211,["There must be something wrong."]],[4213,["Now what is that wrong?”"]],[4214,["Try to correct it."]],[4216,["First of all they must direct their attention","to themselves then they will start settling"]],[4220,["down."]],[4221,["But all the time, supposing, I have seen many","people who come to Sahaja Yoga: out of them"]],[4225,["some say, “I saw one Sahaja Yogi who was","like this!”"]],[4228,["They see to others: how they are are, how","they are, how they are."]],[4232,["You should see to yourself because this is","for your benevolence, for your betterment."]],[4237,["So the first attitude should be, “What have","I gained?"]],[4241,["What have I to gain?"]],[4243,["How am I to get better?”"]],[4247,["Or else there could be some people who think","that, “I must get better."]],[4253,["My health should be alright."]],[4254,["I didn’t get kshema, benevolence, as was","promised by Sahaja Yogis!”"]],[4259,["No, something wrong with you: still the yoga","is not established."]],[4263,["First establish your yoga."]],[4264,["If you have not established your yoga how","can you get what you want?"]],[4270,["So, first of all it’s such a genuine effort."]],[4273,["One has to be absolutely genuinely asking","for that yoga."]],[4277,["And you cannot force people."]],[4279,["You cannot force it."]],[4281,["Whatever lecture you may give."]],[4282,["You may like my lectures or anything, they","might sound very good but it doesn’t matter."]],[4287,["It must go into your being."]],[4289,["It must work out in your being."]],[4291,["You have to become something."]],[4293,["You should certify yourself that, “Yes,","yes."]],[4295,["I am like that.\""]],[4298,["We may be very few – doesn’t matter."]],[4300,["It’s meant for the few."]],[4301,["It cannot be given to every funny type of","a person or a person who is just forced into"]],[4307,["Sahaja Yoga."]],[4308,["You cannot force it."]],[4309,["It’s not like winning over election, you","see, that you make somebody a communist and"]],[4315,["overnight he becomes a capitalist."]],[4317,["It’s not like that."]],[4319,["It’s the inner growth."]],[4321,["And only those who are deserving, who have","that value of their own existence – only"]],[4328,["such people can come."]],[4330,["So you cannot force on them at all!"]],[4333,["They have to see to it."]],[4334,["And what they have to see in other people","[is] that what are they doing that they are"]],[4338,["so much settled."]],[4339,["And there should be an understanding that","we have just now entered into the university,"]],[4344,["say for example: a new class we are in."]],[4348,["Now how are we to go higher and higher?"]],[4350,["Their attitude has to be that way."]],[4353,["You cannot force things into them."]],[4355,["It’s like I always say [that] I have cooked","for you, the food is ready."]],[4359,["If you are hungry you will eat it."]],[4361,["I cannot force the food into your mouth!"]],[4363,["You have to taste it yourself and enjoy."]],[4365,["But there’s a gap, gap between when they","get Realisation and when they feel joy because"]],[4371,["specially in the West they have no idea as","to what Realisation is, they have never known"]],[4376,["the Kundalini."]],[4377,["It’s a new language to them, everything","is new, so they have to be given little assistance"]],[4382,["and help to tell them that, “No, there is","joy!"]],[4386,["You have to go beyond."]],[4387,["You have to see [that] these things exist."]],[4390,["Whatever the saints have said is true."]],[4391,["Whatever the scriptures have described is","true and you can find out."]],[4395,["But you have to have patience with yourself.\""]],[4397,["But if they want to criticise and they want","to say, “Oh, how can that be?"]],[4401,["And how can that be?”"]],[4402,["Such people will take too much time!"]],[4405,["But there must be some genuine seekers."]],[4408,["And there are some slow movers also so accordingly","they move and you cannot force them."]],[4413,["At the most you can support them for a while","but then again they drop down."]],[4420,["You have seen that."]],[4421,["It’s happening every time in the West specially,","not in India."]],[4426,["Not in India."]],[4427,["Not that, also, in [Indian] villages – it","doesn’t happen."]],[4428,["Once you get six thousand you get six thousand","– finished!"]],[4431,["I have known least of them."]],[4433,["I don’t know who they are [but] they are","there."]],[4435,["You meet them somewhere and they’ll just","come and fall at my feet and say, “Mother"]],[4439,["I am a Sahaja Yogi.\""]],[4441,["I said, “I know that."]],[4444,["I know you are."]],[4445,["You are my children I know just from your","presence I know you are my children.\""]],[4450,["So they have to become that."]],[4453,["You cannot force."]],[4454,["That’s one thing we do not realise."]],[4456,["You see, now, in the churches they are compromising,","“Let’s have a disco dance!"]],[4466,["And in the disco dance when the people will","come then we will have some Christians there.\""]],[4474,["Imagine!"]],[4475,["People who are going to disco dance how can","they be Christians?"]],[4480,["And this kind of a compromise is there because","it’s a money-oriented stuff."]],[4485,["It is not God-oriented, it’s money-oriented."]],[4487,["So, “We must have more people so that we","have more money so we can have more clergies,"]],[4491,["we can give more pay.\""]],[4492,["It’s all on that level [that] it works."]],[4495,["But not in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4497,["In Sahaja Yoga everyone is a temple of God,","everyone is a church of God and everyone has"]],[4503,["to come up to that."]],[4504,["And those who do not have that respect of","oneself, we cannot force."]],[4509,["How can you say, “You must have respect","for yourself!”"]],[4511,["Can you say like that?"]],[4513,["I mean, it’s something not possible."]],[4516,["That’s what you all people should know."]],[4519,["Also we should reconcile to that."]],[4522,["I have done my level best."]],[4525,["Except for standing on my head I have done","everything that is possible but what I find"]],[4530,["is that it’s very difficult."]],[4532,["Too much of ego!"]],[4533,["Too much."]],[4534,["Too much of ego in the West – absolutely","– and they are so ignorant."]],[4538,["They have never heard the name of Kundalini,","can you imagine?"]],[4541,["What tremendous ignorance there is."]],[4543,["But those who are wise, those who have pure","intelligence, came to Sahaja Yoga, they learnt"]],[4548,["everything, they know so much."]],[4550,["And some of the Sahaja Yogis in the West know","more than Indians know, I know."]],[4557,["We can say that there are many good Indian","Sahaja Yogis but there are some excellent"]],[4561,["ones in the West."]],[4564,["Par excellence, I should say, some of them","are."]],[4569,["So that’s it."]],[4573,["So why worry?"]],[4574,["We have the quality, if not the quantity."]],[4581,["But this quality only is going to attract","these ego people."]],[4585,["That’s only going to attract them, nothing","else."]],[4588,["This quality of your personality, of your","temperament, of your behaviour, everything"]],[4592,["is going to attract them."]],[4594,["But supposing tomorrow you say, “Alright,","I’ll make a holey jeans,” and walk about"]],[4601,["with the holes in the jeans and then people","will say, “What a nice Sahaja Yogi he is!”"]],[4612,["It’s not the way!"]],[4616,["You must have your own personality, you must","have your own dignity."]],[4618,["You shouldn’t behave like them."]],[4621,["But you should not condemn them either."]],[4623,["Know that they are ignorant."]],[4624,["They have no idea."]],[4625,["They don’t have the knowledge of the roots","at all."]],[4628,["You have the knowledge, so you have to be","kind like a teacher is kind to his students."]],[4637,["I never expected that in the West I’ll be","able to talk to so many people myself."]],[4641,["I mean, in the beginning when I came here","they used to say, “This Victorian old woman!”"]],[4649,["And all kinds of things they branded me with."]],[4650,["So it’s alright."]],[4651,["I didn’t mind that time."]],[4652,["Now they are alright."]],[4654,["That’s how they are, what can you do?"]],[4658,["To begin with they brand you, they do this","and do that."]],[4662,["Hmm."]],[4663,["Any other question?"]],[4666,["But the society you can form and get to people","who believe in a proper life, a healthy life"]],[4673,["and healthy society."]],[4675,["You can start a society like that, saying","that, “We want to belong to the healthy"]],[4679,["society.\""]],[4680,["You can take your children to that kind of","a thing."]],[4682,["You can get other children: where there are","no drugs and things like that."]],[4685,["You can start on that level."]],[4687,["Maybe from there you might get some people."]],[4692,["Anything else?"]],[4700,["Gavin Brown: Shri Mataji, whenever you speak","the questions go away!"]],[4718,["Shri Mataji: You jump into thoughtless awareness,","I know that."]],[4721,["Gavin Brown: There’s one thing we’d like","to ask you is to accept your birthday present"]],[4730,["a little early."]],[4731,["Shri Mataji: A birthday present?"]],[4732,["I mean if you have so many birthdays I’ll","become older very fast! (laughter)"]],[4741,["Oh, Gavin."]],[4743,["So sweet!"]],[4746,["Gavin Brown: Something very little."]],[4753,["Shri Mataji: You always say so!"]],[4758,["Thank you very much."]],[4762,["Thank you."]],[4763,["(applause) You better open and show them,","I don’t know what it is like."]],[4776,["They’ll be very happy to see that."]],[4809,["Those who have got Left Vishuddhi, I would","suggest you sit down with your left hand towards"]],[4813,["me and one hand on the Mother Earth – will","solve the problem immediately."]],[4817,["Just have it."]],[4820,["Left Vishuddhi."]],[4823,["Call your mother here."]],[4825,["Let her have a candle."]],[4838,["Left hand towards me and right hand [on Mother","Earth]."]],[4846,["What’s it Gavin?"]],[4851,["It’s quite a big thing."]],[4860,["It’s so many pieces."]],[4867,["I hope not you have spent so much money."]],[4874,["You can say the mantra in your heart, “Mother","I am not guilty.\""]],[4887,["First [for] your mother, just give her this","candle."]],[4899,["What’s that?"]],[4900,["Oh Gavin!"]],[4901,["Beautiful isn’t it?"]],[4903,["And a dolphin there!"]],[4904,["Just imagine!"]],[4905,["Thank you very much it’s beautiful."]],[4908,["It’s beautiful."]],[4910,["It’s very, very beautiful."]],[4915,["Beautiful."]],[4916,["Thank you very much."]],[4921,["Haa!"]],[4922,["Gavin Brown: It’s French."]],[4927,["Shri Mataji: It’s French?"]],[4932,["Why not get something English from English?"]],[4935,["Alright."]],[4936,["It’s alright."]],[4938,["For me it’s alright."]],[4941,["Aha."]],[4942,["Working out!"]],[4952,["Better?"]],[4961,["Cancer patients should be treated with this,","those who have got cancer or anything left-sided,"]],[4966,["psychosomatic."]],[4968,["The other day, doctor – you will be amazed","– there was a lady who came, she had cancer"]],[4972,["of the glands and she had tied up her head","with a scarf, in Madras."]],[4977,["So while talking I told her, “You take a","candle and sit there with your left hand towards"]],[4982,["me and right hand outside.\""]],[4985,["And after ten minutes I said, “Alright,","remove your scarf.\""]],[4988,["The whole thing was cured."]],[4994,["It’s tremendous."]],[4997,["And they have now started that PhD thing in","India."]],[5005,["Better?"]],[5011,["Much better."]],[5024,["It’s working out."]],[5036,["Good."]],[5041,["(Shri Mataji talks to some children)"]],[5059,["Akshay, you didn’t give me a kiss!"]],[5069,["You must give me a kiss too!"]],[5082,["Alright give it to Olympia then!"]],[5089,["Feeling shy!"]],[5090,["So I think I’ll take your leave Gavin."]],[5093,["Is it alright?"]],[5094,["So tomorrow I don’t think you can come early","in the morning, it’s too early – to the"]],[5128,["airport."]],[5133,["And I’ll be leaving about seven o’clock","from the house, at seven thirty-five I’ll"]],[5158,["be there."]],[5159,["Are you alright now?"]],[5161,["Good?"]],[5162,["So where’s the baby?"]],[5163,["Where’s Wendy’s baby?"]],[5164,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: It’s in Southampton","Mother."]],[5165,["Shri Mataji: Oh I see."]],[5167,["So you want to have the name?"]],[5171,["When was she born?"]],[5176,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: She was born on the","thirteen of February."]],[5188,["Shri Mataji: So call her ‘Himakanya’."]],[5193,["Himakanya is the name of the Goddess born","when…’Hima’ means ‘the snow’."]],[5202,["That’s the time she was born, when it was","snowing."]],[5221,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: It’s a boy Mother."]],[5232,["Shri Mataji: No."]],[5235,["Then ‘Himanshu’."]],[5237,["‘Himanshu’ is alright."]],[5240,["It’s a boy."]],[5243,["I thought it’s a girl they said."]],[5247,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: No, no."]],[5249,["It’s a boy Mother."]],[5251,["Shri Mataji: Alright, so ‘Himanshu’."]],[5254,["It’s good."]],[5255,["‘Himanshu’ is a good name."]],[5257,["‘Himanshu’ means ‘the one who is born","out of the..’ ‘anshu’ means ‘the essence’"]],[5267,["‘Hima’ means ‘the ice’."]],[5270,["He’s the essence of the ice."]],[5271,["‘Himanshu’."]],[5272,["Is the name of Shiva."]],[5274,["(Mother meets another young child)"]],[5282,["This is a new one?"]],[5290,["New Sahaja Yogini?"]],[5298,["Aaah."]],[5301,["That’s Leela."]],[5306,["You want some chana?"]],[5311,["Leela’s sister: She likes that."]],[5318,["Shri Mataji: Do"]],[5332,["you like that?"]],[5334,["Alright, I’ll give her some chana."]],[5338,["Now only two can fit in here and let’s fit","the others there."]],[5350,["Alright."]],[5351,["So you carry some more."]],[5356,["She has big hands now!"]],[5358,["Come along, have some more."]],[5360,["You have big, big hands now."]],[5361,["You’ve become a big girl I must say!"]]]);
